# Build context exclusions. Everything the image needs is source, manifests and
# the lockfile — dependencies and build output are produced inside the builder
# stage so the image never inherits whatever the host happened to have.

# Dependencies and build output
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist
dev-dist
**/dev-dist
.next
out
**/*.tsbuildinfo

# Caches
.turbo
**/.turbo
.pnpm-store
**/coverage

# Version control and CI metadata
.git
.github
.gitignore
.dockerignore

# Local data. Never copy a database or a live pairing PIN into an image.
**/*.db
**/*.db-shm
**/*.db-wal
pairing_pin.txt
**/pairing_pin.txt
.asterim
.agentdeck

# Secrets
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example

# Logs
**/*.log
**/npm-debug.log*
**/pnpm-debug.log*

# Agent workflow files and documentation — not part of any runtime
.agents
tasks
tests
reports
docs
blueprint
scratch
temp_test_nogit
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
README.md

# Editor and OS noise
.vscode
.idea
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Leftover debug scripts (see CLAUDE.md § Housekeeping)
**/test-*.js
**/run-loop-test*.js
**/test_*.ts
**/clear_*.js
